Source: sparklink
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: sanchuanhehe <wyihe5220@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), debhelper (>= 13.24.2), cargo (>= 1.96.1), rustc (>= 1.96.1), python3 (>= 3.11), pkgconf, binutils
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/OpenSparklink/sparklink

Package: sparklink
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dbus, systemd | systemd-standalone-sysusers
Description: SparkLink wireless protocol userspace stack
 Development userspace infrastructure for SparkLink (星闪). Includes the
 management daemon and command-line tools. Capability and device qualification
 are limited to the source-bound project records; full protocol support is
 not implied by package installation.

Package: libsparklink0
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: SparkLink shared library
 Authorized-channel C API (libsparklink.so.0) and separate explicit Native
 library (libslk_native.so.0). Application calls do not grant controller
 management authority. Full broker/SSAP language clients remain incomplete.

Package: libsparklink-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends: libsparklink0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: SparkLink development headers
 C header file (sparklink.h) for developing applications against
 libsparklink.
